# Publish this package to PUBLIC npm, not GitHub Packages.
# The org's .npmrc pins @smart-compost to npm.pkg.github.com (for smartcompost-ui);
# this local override sends @smart-compost/mcp to the public registry so external
# integrators can `npx -y @smart-compost/mcp` without org access.
# No auth token here — `npm login` / NODE_AUTH_TOKEN supplies that at publish time.
@smart-compost:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
